    "detailed_description": "<h1>release </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >release coming this Friday!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREEPS: Halls of Insanity</strong> is not just another horror game\u2014it\u2019s a mind-bending plunge into terror. Navigate a chilling labyrinth where every twist could be your last, and survival is your only objective. With intuitive controls (WASD movement + T to toggle your flashlight), you'll stalk through shadows, haunted corridors, and hallways teeming with suspense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the nerve to face what lurks in the dark? Brace yourself for one of the most intense maze experiences on the market. But be warned: <strong>flashing lights, disturbing imagery, and light gore</strong> await those bold enough to enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape... if you can.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREEPS: Halls of Insanity</strong> is not just another horror game\u2014it\u2019s a mind-bending plunge into terror. Navigate a chilling labyrinth where every twist could be your last, and survival is your only objective. With intuitive controls (WASD movement + T to toggle your flashlight), you'll stalk through shadows, haunted corridors, and hallways teeming with suspense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the nerve to face what lurks in the dark? Brace yourself for one of the most intense maze experiences on the market. But be warned: <strong>flashing lights, disturbing imagery, and light gore</strong> await those bold enough to enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape... if you can.</strong></p>",
